# A sanitized cut of a Looker Studio report textproto dump of the live BQCA
# template 42e79a1f-a979-4de8-911f-80d5a99543d5, saved on 2026-10-29 before the
# sync tracked in
# https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/BigQuery-Agent-Analytics-SDK/issues/559.
#
# The fields that
# `dashboards/looker_studio/tools/validate_contracts.py --live-report-textproto`
# reads are kept, in their original order: the report-level `datasource_id`,
# the `ds0` data source alias and, for each of the 34 components, its
# `component_id` and `datasource_id`, its dataset, dimension, metric and sort
# references (including each `labeled_concepts` `key` and `reverse_sort_order`),
# and each concept's `id`, `name`, source field and aggregation. Every other
# field of the dump is dropped. One value is
# replaced: the report-level `datasource_id` named the source report's retired
# data source, which this repository does not name, and reads
# 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000 here.
#
# tests/test_looker_studio_dashboard.py pins the audit's verdict on this file
# (209 errors) and on its remapped twin,
# bqca_live_report_42e79a1f_sanitized_remapped.textproto (no errors).
